<div class='main_cred'>
  <div class='main_cred_row'>
    <h2> Кредит на специальных условиях</h2>
  </div>

  <div class='main_cred_row '>
    <div class='main_cred-col first'>
      <div class='cred-small'>Первый взнос</div>
      <div class='cred-big' id='field1'>-</div>
    </div>
    <div class='main_cred-col first'>
      <div class='cred-small'>Ежемесячный платеж</div>
      <div class='cred-big' style='color:var(--color-red)' id='field3'>-</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style='clear: both'></div>


  <div class='main_cred_row'>
    <div class='main_cred-col'>
      <div class='cred-small'>Cумма кредита</div>
      <div class='cred-big' id='field2'>-</div>

      <div class='slider__ui slider1'>
        <div class='slider__ui-range' style='width: 50%'></div>
        <span tabindex='0' class='slider__ui-handle' style='left: calc(50% - 10px)'></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='main_cred-col'>
      <div class='cred-small'>Срок кредита</div>
      <div class='cred-big' id='field4'>5 лет</div>

      <div class='slider__ui slider2'>
        <div class='slider__ui-range' style='width: 100%'></div>
        <span tabindex='0' class='slider__ui-handle' style='left: calc(100% - 10px)'></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style='clear: both'></div>


  <div class='fileds'>
    <div class='main_cred_row'>
      <div class='main_cred-col field name'>
        <label class='placehold' for='you_name'> Ваше имя *</label>
        <input placeholder=' ' name='you_name' required onmouseenter='this.focus()'>
      </div>
      <div class='main_cred-col field tel'>
        <label class='placehold'> Ваш телефон *</label>
        <input placeholder=' ' name='phone' required onmouseenter='this.focus()' oninput='formattingPhone(this)'>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style='clear: both'></div>


    <div class='main_cred_row'>
      <div class='main_cred-col'>
        <button class='page__btn page__btn--main bid ' style='width: 100%; height: 46px'> Оставить заявку</button>
      </div>
      <div class='main_cred-col' style='text-align: right'>
        <div class='capctha-div n3'></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style='clear: both'></div>


    <div class='main_cred_row'>
      <div class='main_cred-col sender'>
        <span><input type='checkbox' id='n3'></span>
        <label for='n3'>
          Нажав кнопку «Отправить» я даю согласие
          на обработку персональных <a href='/privacy-policy/' target='_blank'>данных</a>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div  class='main_cred-col sender'>
        <span><input type="checkbox" name="agree" id="personal_agree2"></span>
        <label for="personal_agree2" style="cursor: pointer">
          Согласие на рекламную <a href="/privacy-policy/agreement.html" target="_blank">коммуникацию</a>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style='clear: both'></div>


    <div class='main_cred_row'>
      <div class='main_cred-col desk'>
        Заполните форму и мы свяжемся с вами в течение 30 мин. для уточнения деталей.
        Или позвоните прямо сейчас по
        номеру <a href='tel:88005001156'>8-800-500-11-56</a>
      </div>
      <div class='main_cred-col'>

      </div>
    </div>
    <br><br>
  </div>

</div>